      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even about a \"break\" though. a break is just a pause in the execution. i mean like... if a program has a bug that makes it useless, you don't just pause it, you just delete the file. you clear the memory. i feel like i'm just occupying space that doesn't belong to me anymore. like there's no actual 'me' left to find.",
